s to be lemons and bunnies. I would also like gifts under the tree. I want to use this picture in a youtube video, so can you please make it so you can seperate the background from the PNG, or make the background transparent. I would love for her to look very happy and having fun. I am looking forward to it! Thank you so much.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/shrike_exe/status/1458291080403767300/photo/1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hoshi_25f/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/263245eb/uploads/origins/e7839d7d-be5c-4c66-9334-f74985c31195?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=976e36fdb55e6d8cf00ef675ef120161", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/263245eb/uploads/origins/e7839d7d-be5c-4c66-9334-f74985c31195?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=976e36fdb55e6d8cf00ef675ef120161, https://si.imgix.net/263245eb/uploads/origins/e7839d7d-be5c-4c66-9334-f74985c31195?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a37986eace0427c9730386521ac054ce 2x, https://si.imgix.net/263245eb/uploads/origins/e7839d7d-be5c-4c66-9334-f74985c31195?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9430c5fcca0b8b4f7887d4ff3f2d6da9 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちわあなたの絵はとてもかわいいですね!  彼女は魔法使いですが、タロットを使って精霊と話す占い師でもあります。彼女は親切でフレンドリーで、心配性な人です。どんなポーズでも構いません！好きな宝石は自由に省略してください！ご検討よろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/MlYnZxu", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hoshi_25f/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6bea1575/uploads/origins/5a981dce-81b2-4423-86b5-6a35d71ed05d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=88d64d0510067c4191fff4ddff6f9d44", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6bea1575/uploads/origins/5a981dce-81b2-4423-86b5-6a35d71ed05d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=88d64d0510067c4191fff4ddff6f9d44, https://si.imgix.ne